  "bodyHash": "8789cfe3a818871a",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Homestead/BH_Homestead_header.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">官方 Homestead 模組包</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b22205d972d2006c6bd3ff913524a33f8a5761e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252ftokimi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Homestead/BH_Homestead_promo2.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Homestead/BH_Homestead_videos.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/edm0HUj9sTg\" width=\"775\" height=\"437\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4F1_rLGVyLM\" width=\"775\" height=\"437\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Lq32O22MDhw\" width=\"775\" height=\"435\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LbWjmckHuNw\" width=\"775\" height=\"437\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fcached_images%252f5b22205d972d2006c6bd3ff913524a33f8a5761e.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b22205d972d2006c6bd3ff913524a33f8a5761e.png</a>)</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\">![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fimages%252fCF%252fHomestead%252fBH_Homestead_features.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Homestead/BH_Homestead_features.webp</a>)</h2>\n<h3>🌎 豐富的手工打造世界：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ftectonic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tectonic</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fgeophilic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geophilic</a> 等模組，為您帶來擁有繁茂森林、遼闊田野、崎嶇山脈與寧靜河流的自訂世界生成。</li>\n<li>在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frepurposed-structures-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Repurposed Structures</a> 以及 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fYUNGNICKYOUNG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG</a> 所有模組的協助下，手動放置的建築與程序生成的遺蹟完美融入自然景觀。</li>\n<li>透過地形增強模組增加生態域多樣性，同時保留如 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnatures-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nature's Spirit</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes We've Gone</a> 帶來的溫馨「原版+」體驗。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>📖 有引導卻自由的遊玩體驗：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>內容豐富的任務書，獎勵探索、創意與生存技巧的精進&nbsp;</li>\n<li>章節依主題劃分（拓荒定居、荒野探索、深層採礦、魔法秘辛）</li>\n<li>無強制路線——以您自己的節奏與方式進行探索</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🎨 內建着色器，打造極致電影級視覺體驗：</h3>\n<p>Homestead 已預載精美的着色器——無需額外下載！</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complimentary Reimagined</a> - 提供三種預設檔：低、中、極高</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fnostalgia-shader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nostalgia Shader</a> - 營造柔和夢幻的氛圍</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fmakeup-ultra-fast-shaders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MakeUp - UltraFast</a> - 輕量且高度可自訂</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fpotato-shaders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Potato Shaders</a> - 適合較低階電腦</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fsuper-duper-vanilla\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Super Duper Vanilla</a> - 經典 Minecraft 風格搭配優美光影</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🛠️ 擴充的生存體驗：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmythic-upgrades\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Upgrades</a> 模組，新增由紅寶石、黃玉、橄欖石、藍寶石、翡翠、海藍寶石及紫黃晶等自訂寶石化作的工具與盔甲</li>\n<li>自訂合成配方與重新平衡的原版進度系統，提供更緩慢但回報豐厚的生存體驗</li>\n<li>搭配 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffarmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fcollection%252fqKHEyt1l%252fmods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's Do Mods</a> 等模組，為作物、樹木與畜牧業加入更寫實的農場經營元素</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🐾 全新野生動物與生物：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>來自我們的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cozystudios-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Custom CozyStudios Core Mod!</strong></a> 的自訂生物，例如<strong>Mushlings</strong> 與<strong>Fernlings</strong>——可馴服並一同冒險的友好夥伴</li>\n<li>獨特坐騎與可騎乘生物自然融入遊戲世界</li>\n<li>生物變種與迷你首領潛伏於洞穴、森林與隱蔽林地中</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🧭 探索與冒險：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>古蹟、遺蹟、神龕與秘密散佈於大地各處</li>\n<li>尋寶活動與稀有神器（如能賦予特殊能力的<strong>金葉</strong>）</li>\n<li>神秘生態域棲息著稀有生物、魔法植物與強大遺物</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🏡 溫馨建築與拓荒定居：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fchipped\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chipped</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftwigs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twigs</a> 等模組，提供數百種建築方塊，包含各式木材、石材、瓦片、樑柱與溫馨裝飾</li>\n<li>搭配 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcluttered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cluttered</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbeautify-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Beautify: Refabricated</a> 等家具、照明與裝飾模組，打造您理想的鄉間小屋、城堡或木屋</li>\n<li>感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fironchests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron Chests: Restocked</a> 等模組，提供進階儲存方案（箱子、板條箱、背包等！）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>⚙️ 機械與魔法強化：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>結合專為 Homestead 調整的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 模組強化內容，提供原版風格的自動化系統</li>\n<li>符合鄉村氛圍且平衡的選用科技模組（無高科技雜亂感），例如 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftoms-storage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tom's Simple Storage</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwirelessredstone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wireless Redstone</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🧡 用心打造的傑作：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>耗時超過 4 個月的開發，手動調校每個系統，打造溫暖迷人的生存體驗</li>\n<li>無論是獨行冒險者、小規模好友團隊或社群伺服器皆適合遊玩</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b22205d972d2006c6bd3ff913524a33f8a5761e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>前往維基頁面查看更多資訊，並追蹤您發現的問題或錯誤！&nbsp;</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/iamtokimi/homestead/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-Wiki-181717?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white&label=Github\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qHB5D9uzHe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1314787848779726920?color=blue&label=Discord&logo=Discord&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@iamtokimii\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCAdrG5UY_FB68fDC2G8PTpA?style=for-the-badge&label=Youtube&labelColor=CD201F\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b22205d972d2006c6bd3ff913524a33f8a5761e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>💞 特別感謝</h2>\n<h3>感謝所有參與測試版的玩家，幫我們找出各種潛在的錯誤與問題。&nbsp;</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIaVT7Cm0ilw9Rjd8i0J-7g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Meleon (次要開發者)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCH4IkMCZ92_OHgeNM9imstA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xodk</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/valusdagon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Army</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsteamcommunity.com%252fprofiles%252f76561199141628758\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lyn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYHsM506gBSsBxejoOTJTrA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alexelle</a></li>\n<li>Nylon</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/gonzozeroone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gonzo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaTjVD_qZHOVspTK_cVsX8g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/mama_native\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mama Native</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/snowylasvegasttv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Snowylasvegas</a></li>\n<li>Wistericle</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/kawatsuki15\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yuki</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnavinor.carrd.co%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Navinor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSodaSyrup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Salad (後端開發者)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>感謝協助我們編寫專屬模組、將瘋狂構想化為現實的模組開發者們。</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjavivi.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Javivi (開發者)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.fiverr.com%252fraboy13\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Raboy (動畫師)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.fiverr.com%252ffflash_\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flash (模型/紋理)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fLunarEclipseStudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bret06 (開發者)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvgen.co%252fartmanoil\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Artmanoil (自訂介面/紋理包設計師)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgigoe.shop%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gigoe (主選單/載入畫面美術)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>並感謝 Slugv 為這款精美的模組包設計了最棒的 Logo 與圖示。沒有您，這一切無法如此完美地實現。</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b22205d972d2006c6bd3ff913524a33f8a5761e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
